<title>MALAYSIA: Bank Negara borrows for 1-mth deposit at 7.05 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara borrows for 1-mth deposit at 7.05 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Negara Malaysia said it borrowed for a one-month deposit at an unchanged 7.05 percent as part of its open market intervention operations.</p>
<p>Bank Negara regularly intervenes in the domestic money market to either keep liquidity under check or set interest rates.</p>
</text>
